# Navigation Flowchart Diagram

```
Start Navigation → Sense Environment → Plan Path → Execute Movement → Monitor Progress
       ↓               ↓                ↓            ↓                  ↓
Goal Reached? ←──── Check Obstacles ←─ Check Path ←─ Check Balance ←───┘
       │                │                │            │
       ├─ Yes ─→ Return Success          │            │
       │                │                │            │
       └─ No ─←─────────┼────────────────┼────────────┘
                        │                │
                        ↓                ↓
                Dynamic Replanning → Adjust Path
                        │                │
                        └←───────────────┘
```

## Description

This flowchart illustrates the navigation process for humanoid robots, showing the continuous cycle of sensing, planning, executing, and monitoring. The robot checks for obstacles and path validity in real-time, performing dynamic replanning when necessary. The flowchart emphasizes the iterative nature of navigation, with continuous monitoring and adjustment to ensure safe and effective movement toward goals.